    <item>
      <title>Version 1.31.0</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>Screenshot annotation tools (draw, overlay, toolbar)</li>
<li>Menu bar</li>
</ul>

<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
<li>Sentry error logging with dedicated helpers</li>
<li>Add track modal improvements</li>
<li>Dashboard and menu bar UI cleanup</li>
<li>Expanded test coverage (clip operations, export geometry, SRT/VTT parsers, Sentry helpers)</li>
</ul>


<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>App hangs caused by AVPlayer polling and device discovery running on the main thread</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
